menu "Portero Device Config"

config PORTERO_POWER_CUT_TEST
    bool "Pause before active-marker commit (laboratory only)"
    default n
    help
        When enabled, device_config_save() logs POWER_CUT_TEST_READY
        and blocks indefinitely after committing the new slot data but
        before writing the active-slot pointer. Use this to verify
        recovery from a power cut at that exact boundary. Disable and
        rebuild after the test.

endmenu
